From 2f25b45f1533366bf0b5988c0b1783a50bb20f8c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@users.invalid>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 19:57:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Shaders: ClipDistance -> [[clip_distance]], Invariant ->
 [[position, invariant]] + preserveInvariance, OpKill demotes outside loops
 (quad derivatives after clip()), texel-fetch offsets applied,
 alpha-to-coverage at 1x as an alpha test (VP_A2C1), storage-texture access
 from use; translator v3

